THREAT ASSESSMENT - THE FIVE KAGE
Prepared for Leader. Distribution restricted to active members.

Fifth Hokage (Tsunade, Leaf): Sannin-tier medical ninja, immense strength,
Creation Rebirth grants prolonged combat endurance. Village heavily fortified.
Do not engage her directly; extract the Nine-Tails host by isolation, not assault.

Fourth Raikage (A, Cloud): Fastest of the Kage, Lightning Release Armour. Personally
guards the Eight-Tails host, his brother. Direct extraction cost prohibitive.

Fifth Kazekage (Gaara, Sand): Former One-Tail host. Absolute sand defence. Already
processed (see extraction reports). Village on alert since.

Third Tsuchikage (Onoki, Rock): Dust Release (particle disintegration). Aged but lethal.

Fifth Mizukage (Mei, Mist): Lava and Boil Release. Village recovering from bloody era.
Historical leverage exists via prior manipulation of the Fourth Mizukage.
